<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Anime Isekai Terbaik Sepanjang Masa</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
            background: #f5f5f5;
            color: #333;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.7), rgba(0,0,0,0.7)), 
                        url('images/header-index.jpg') no-repeat center center/cover;
            padding: 5rem 2rem;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            color: white;
        }

        .nav-menu {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            background: #2c3e50;
            padding: 1.2rem;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
        }

        .nav-menu a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 0.8rem 1.5rem;
            margin: 0 0.5rem;
            border-radius: 25px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .nav-menu a:hover {
            background: #e74c3c;
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 2rem;
        }

        .article-grid {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 2rem;
            margin: 2rem 0;
        }

        .article-card {
            flex: 1 1 300px;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 10px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        .article-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-10px);
        }

        .card-img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 200px;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        .card-content {
            padding: 1.5rem;
        }

        .footer {
            background: #2c3e50;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem;
            margin-top: 3rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header class="header">
        <h1>Anime Isekai Terbaik Sepanjang Masa</h1>
        <p>Rekomendasi anime isekai dengan cerita dan karakter terbaik</p>
    </header>

    <nav class="nav-menu">
        <a href="index.html">Beranda</a>
        <a href="mushoku.html">Mushoku Tensei</a>
        <a href="zero.html">Zero no Tsukaima</a>
        <a href="noni.html">Isekai Nonbiri</a>
    </nav>

    <div class="container">
        <h2>Rekomendasi Anime Isekai</h2>
        
        <div class="article-grid">
            <div class="article-card">
                <img src="images/mushoku-thumb.jpg" alt="Mushoku Tensei" class="card-img">
                <div class="card-content">
                    <h3>Mushoku Tensei</h3>
                    <p>Kisah reinkarnasi seorang NEET ke dunia fantasi dengan pengembangan karakter terbaik dalam genre isekai.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="article-card">
                <img src="images/zero-thumb.jpg" alt="Zero no Tsukaima" class="card-img">
                <div class="card-content">
                    <h3>Zero no Tsukaima</h3>
                    <p>Klasik isekai tentang siswa SMA yang dipanggil ke dunia sihir sebagai familiar seorang penyihir.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="article-card">
                <img src="images/noni-thumb.jpg" alt="Isekai Nonbiri" class="card-img">
                <div class="card-content">
                    <h3>Isekai Nonbiri Nouka</h3>
                    <p>Isekai slice-of-life unik tentang mantan salaryman yang membangun pertanian di dunia fantasi.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer class="footer">
        <p>© 2025 Portal Anime Isekai</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
